# ── Build and environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────
**.pyc
.venv/
.project
.pydevproject
.settings/

# ── Capture data and generated output ────────────────────────────────────
# The capture pipeline emits these in bulk; they are data, not source.
**.csv
**.txt
**.jpg
**.npy
**.h5
**.sqlite
**.prof
**.log
docs/.~lock.*

# ── Project source and configuration ─────────────────────────────────────
# Re-included from the data rules above: hand-maintained files the project
# cannot be rebuilt without. Negations must follow the rule they override,
# so keep this block last.
!src/*.csv
!requirements-frozen.txt
!system_requirements.txt
!sync_pi_files.txt
!commissioning/*.txt

# ── Local-only symlinks ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Absolute-path links into ~/Documents; would dangle on any other clone.
commissioning/ssh-key-setup-guide.md
commissioning/ssh-terminal-color.md
